### Health
GET http://localhost:4000/api/health

### Signup
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234",
  "name": "Test User"
}

### Login (captures token automatically)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:4000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "test1234"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Me
GET http://localhost:4000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a note
# @name createNote
POST http://localhost:4000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My first note",
  "content": "Hello, secure world!"
}

### List my notes
GET http://localhost:4000/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update the note we just created
@noteId = {{createNote.response.body.note.id}}

PUT http://localhost:4000/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated title",
  "content": "Updated content"
}

### Delete that note
DELETE http://localhost:4000/api/notes/{{noteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ADMIN: List all users
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ADMIN: List all notes from all users
GET http://localhost:4000/api/admin/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}